  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "學術研究架構與發表",
    "sub_ename": "ACADEMIC RESEARCH FRAMEWORK AND PUBLICATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程在教導學生如何籌畫與撰寫學術研究。目的為使其學習如何施行文獻探討、逐步進行、與指導老師交流互動，進而成功投稿。此學期將藉由導讀與論述現有論文，引導學生提交自己的研究。選擇撰寫答辯用的畢業論文，抑或是得以發表於學術期刊的研究論文，並於期末發表自己的論文；部分將有機會獲得公開發表。",
    "describe_eh": "This course teaches students how to prepare and compose their academic research. The aim is for them to learn how to conduct literature review, phase their work, communicate with a supervisor, and successfully submit. This means preparing either a graduation thesis for defense or a research article for publication in a scientific journal. Existing theses and articles are going to be read and discussed. During the semester students are going to be guided to come up with their own research. In the end they will present their research papers, some of which can potentially be submitted for publishing.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
